## Module 2 — Analytics Dashboard

### What It Does

An admin-facing analytics layer that aggregates submission data to surface insights: which questions are bottlenecks, team performance over time, submission volume trends, and participation patterns.

### Why It's Independent

This module is a **pure aggregation layer** — it reads from the existing `submissions`, `teams`, and `questions` collections using MongoDB aggregation pipelines. It adds no new collections and modifies no existing documents.

### API Contract

```
GET /api/analytics/overview
→ Total teams, total submissions, overall solve rate, average score

GET /api/analytics/questions
→ Per-question: attempts, correct %, average time-to-solve, bottleneck score

GET /api/analytics/teams
→ Per-team: score over time, questions solved, hint usage, rank delta

GET /api/analytics/heatmap
→ Submission count bucketed by time (e.g. per 5-minute window)
```

All endpoints require `ADMIN` role (existing `requireAdmin` middleware).

### Key Metrics Computed

| Metric | Description |
|---|---|
| **Solve rate** | `correct submissions / total attempts` per question |
| **Time to solve** | Time between a team's first attempt and first correct submission per question |
| **Bottleneck score** | Questions with low solve rate + high average time-to-solve |
| **Submission heatmap** | Volume of submissions bucketed by timestamp to show peak activity windows |
| **Team rank delta** | How a team's leaderboard position changed over time |

### What I Touch

- **New:** `server/src/controllers/analyticsController.ts` — all aggregation queries
- **New:** `server/src/routes/analyticsRoutes.ts` — mounts `/api/analytics/*`
- **Minor edit:** `server/src/index.ts` — register the analytics route (one line)
- **New:** `client/src/pages/AdminAnalytics.tsx` — the admin analytics UI with charts (already has a route wired up at `/admin/analytics`)

### Frontend Charts

The existing `AdminAnalytics.tsx` page (already routed at `/admin/analytics`) will be populated with:
- Bar chart: solve rate per question
- Line chart: submission volume over time (heatmap timeline)
- Table: team leaderboard with rank delta and hint usage
- Highlight cards: top bottleneck questions, fastest team, most active period

Charts will use a lightweight library (e.g. `recharts`) added to client dependencies.

